ntory. Install the key and certificate separately on the device; check the connection to a consumer in that destination's integration."},"1738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An accessible instance and permission to administer DMSs, devices and certificate associations."},"1739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active CA with an available key. If one does not exist yet, follow Create your first CA."},"1740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active end-entity certificate from that CA whose `Common Name` is exactly `device-001`, together with its private key. Follow Issue and verify a certificate to obtain and check both."},"1741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"The identifier `device-001` available in the inventory. If you already used it, choose another and issue the certificate with that same `Common Name`."},"1742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"A DMS must exist before registering the device. If you already have a suitable one, check its CA and note its identifier; to create one:"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Open the DMS inventory and its creation action. Assign a recognizable name, such as `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Enrollment CA**, select the CA that issued `device.crt`."},"1745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Registration Mode**, select `PRE_REGISTRATION` for the path that starts with explicit registration."},"1746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In the authentication section, enable **Require client certificate** and leave **Call external webhook** off. Under **Require client certificate**, add the CA whose initial certificates you will accept to **Validation CAs**; for this evaluation, it can be the same CA. Keep **Verify CSR Signature** enabled and leave **Enable server-side key generation** off if you will not use it."},"1747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Review renewal and trust distribution settings with the DMS guide, save the service and note its identifier."},"1748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Reopen the DMS and confirm that the enrollment CA is the expected one and the service appears in inventory."},"1749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"These settings prepare DMS policy. The next steps register and assign through the console; they do not send an EST request or test admission through that protocol."},"1750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"Open **Managed Devices** and the registration action. Complete:"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Registration Authority**: the DMS you just prepared; this label identifies the service fulfilling the registration authority role."},"1753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Icon** and **Tags**: optional classification."},"1754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"Confirm registration."},"1755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Open the device. It should appear in **No Identity** and show the selected owning DMS."},"1756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#c