rts the chosen algorithm."},"2538":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"OpenSSL 3.x to check the downloaded certificate."},"2539":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Use an evaluation instance or an authority intended for these tests. The example creates a root that issues directly; to design an operational hierarchy, see Hierarchy and rotation."},"2540":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"In **Certification Authorities**, select **Create New CA** and choose to create a CA with a new key pair."},"2541":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"The &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** flow is explained in the authorities guide."},"2542":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"Choose the engine that will keep the key and an algorithm its capabilities allow. For this example, you can use **EC P-384** if available."},"2543":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"The CA private key is used through the engine. In this path, you will download only the authority's public certificate."},"2544":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2546":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2549":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed to sign certificates and CRLs."},"2550":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#review-and-create-the-ca-toc","content":"Check the engine, algorithm, subject, root type and dates. Confirm creation and note the authority identifier so you can recognize it in the DMS or API."},"2551":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Open the new CA. It should appear active, show its certificate and allow access to **Issued Certificates**."},"2552":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Download or copy the authority's PEM certificate and save it as `ca.pem`. Check that the file contains the complete block, including `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` and `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2553":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Run from the directory where you saved `ca.pem`:"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Check that the subject and issuer match the root you created, the dates include the current time, **Basic Constraints** contains `CA:TRUE` and **Key Usage** allows certificate signing. The last command should return `ca.pem: OK`."},"2555":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"You explicitly selected `ca.pem` as the trust anchor for this test. A valid self-signature does not install that trust in other consumers. See the openssl-verify reference for verification options."},"2556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If creation fails, check permissions, engine availability and the selected algorithm."},"2557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If OpenSSL cannot read the file, copy the complete PEM block again."},"2558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If signature or date checks fail, check that you downloaded this CA's certificate and that your computer's clock is correct."},"2559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"PKI diagnostics covers issuance checks and cryptographic dependencies."},"2560":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#next-step","content":"Continue with Issue and verify a certificate, using this authority and `ca.pem`."},"2561":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Issue and verify a certificate","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","PKI","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Issue a client certificate and check content, chain and key correspondence."},"2563":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"2564":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Start the issuance"},"2565":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"Choose the method"},"2566":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"Identify the certificate"},"2567":{"id":"/d