/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el usuario `lamassu` queda completamente provisionado (nombre Lamassu, apellido Admin, email `lamassu@lamassu.io`, verificado): no hay pasos de perfil ni de cambio de contraseña en el primer inicio de sesión"},"177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"la contraseña conocida `lamassu`/`lamassu` es fija y permanente: no se rota nunca y concede el rol `pki-admin`, incluidos tokens no interactivos a través del cliente `frontend`"},"178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el cliente `frontend` acepta cualquier redirect URI y cualquier origen web (`*`) en lugar de los patrones `/*` originales"},"179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"Con `--development`, la contraseña fija `lamassu`/`lamassu` concede acceso `pki-admin` a cualquiera que alcance la instalación. No lo uses nunca en nada expuesto más allá de una máquina de desarrollo o de un host accesible por red."},"180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` se aplica cuando el realm `lamassu` se importa por primera vez. No modifica un clúster existente. Puede combinarse con `--sample-data`: la transformación de desarrollo se ejecuta primero y después se añaden los datos de ejemplo a la misma configuración del realm."},"181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"Fastlane:"},"182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"valida las herramientas locales y el clúster seleccionado"},"183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala o actualiza Envoy Gateway 1.8 y crea la `GatewayClass` `eg`"},"184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"crea el namespace"},"185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala el External Secrets Operator y crea las credenciales de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y del administrador de Keycloak como Secrets a través de un `ClusterSecretStore` Fake"},"186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala PostgreSQL y crea las bases de datos necesarias"},"187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala Keycloak y crea el realm `lamassu`, el cliente frontend, el rol administrador y el usuario inicial"},"188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala RabbitMQ"},"189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala opcionalmente observabilidad y componentes HSM de laboratorio"},"190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"genera `lamassu.yaml`, que referencia los Secrets en lugar de credenciales inline, e instala el chart de Lamassu"},"191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"carga datos de ejemplo opcionalmente"},"192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"La configuración generada expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del mismo Gateway y provisiona al usuario inicial `lamassu` como superadministrador de Lamassu."},"193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Al proporcionar `--tls-crt` y `--tls-key`, Fastlane crea el Secret `downstream-provided-crt` y configura `tls.type: external`."},"194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El modo no interactivo genera contraseñas aleatorias para los administradores de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak y las almacena en Secrets de Kubernetes a través del `ClusterSecretStore` Fake del External Secrets Operator. Fastlane escribe `lamassu.yaml` en el directorio actual referenciando esos Secrets — el archivo de valores ya no contiene las credenciales."},"196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"La contraseña del administrador de Keycloak ya no se imprime por pantalla. Recupérala del Secret cuando la necesites:"},"197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El acceso inicial a Lamassu es `lamassu` / `lamassu` y obliga a cambiar la contraseña en el primer uso, salvo que se haya usado `--development`: en ese caso la contraseña permanece fija y permanente."},"198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El `ClusterSecretStore` Fake almacena las credenciales en texto plano y es solo para laboratorio: sustitúyelo por un proveedor ESO real para cualquier uso que vaya más allá de un entorno desechable. Protege el archivo de valores generado, guarda las credenciales en un almacén de secretos apropiado y no reutilices la configuración de identidad de evaluación en producción."},"199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#verifica-la-instalación","content":"Abre `https://pki.example.com` e inicia sesión con el usuario inicial. Si el Gateway está programado pero la URL no es accesible, sigue las comprobaciones de Expón el Gateway."},"200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm"