antiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","content":"Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways."},"279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"Expón el Gateway de Lamassu"},"280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"¿Necesitas `gateway.addresses`?"},"281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Diseño recomendado para un solo nodo"},"282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s"},"283":{"id":"/docs