ndpoints"},"949":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-enrollment","content":"Configuración de enrollment"},"950":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"Enrollment Device Registration"},"951":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Enrollment Settings"},"952":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Autenticación por operación"},"953":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Ajustes del webhook externo"},"954":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#perfil-de-emisión","content":"Perfil de emisión"},"955":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Configuración de re-enrollment"},"956":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"957":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Distribución de confianza"},"958":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"Opera el inventario de DMS"},"959":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Integra los dispositivos"},"960":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Un &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** configura la admisión y el ciclo de identidad de sus dispositivos. Actúa como autoridad de registro; la CA indicada en `Enrollment CA` firma los certificados. Esta guía se dirige a quien administra esa política."},"961":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas permisos para gestionar DMS, una CA activa con clave utilizable y un perfil de emisión probado. Acuerda con el integrador ID del dispositivo, credencial inicial, consumidor y ventana de renovación. Revisa la estrategia de aprovisionamiento antes de elegir registro y sustitución."},"962":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor EST y acceso desde el dispositivo con Despliegue. La autenticación administrativa de tu operador no sustituye la autenticación EST del dispositivo."},"963":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Crea el DMS con un nombre reconocible y conserva su ID. Las URLs EST utilizan ese identificador, no el nombre visible. Cada dispositivo conserva un DMS propietario."},"964":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige **Enrollment CA** y un perfil explícito apropiado para la identidad final. Mantén CN compatible con `Device ID`. El certificado de prueba debe permitir el uso previsto y terminar dentro de la vigencia del emisor."},"965":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Selecciona registro y autenticación del primer enrolamiento. Configura por separado la autenticación de reenrolamiento, sus umbrales y la retirada del certificado anterior. Deja ServerKeyGen deshabilitado si el cliente genera su clave."},"966":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Selecciona los certificados que devolverá `/cacerts`. Incluye explícitamente las intermedias y raíces necesarias, sin confundir distribución con instalación automática de confianza."},"967":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Guarda y vuelve a leer la configuración. Consulta `/cacerts`, realiza un enrolamiento permitido y otro rechazado, y comprueba dispositivo, serie e historial. Crear el DMS o descargar cacerts no demuestra que autenticación y emisión funcionen."},"968":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.registration_mode` permite `JITP` o `PRE_REGISTRATION`. En JITP se crea el dispositivo desconocido con el CN de la CSR como ID y el DMS como propietario. El `device_provisioning_profile` aporta etiquetas, metadatos e icono a ese alta."},"969":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"En PRE\\_REGISTRATION, el ID debe existir previamente. Un dispositivo existente pasa antes por el control de sustitución, incluso si no tiene identidad. Consulta las condiciones de prerregistro antes de utilizar este modo."},"970":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Campo de `settings.enrollment_settings`"},"971":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Decisión"},"972":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`protocol`"},"973":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`EST_RFC7030` para estas operaciones."},"974":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enrollment_ca`"},"975":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platf