omprueba la decisión"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","content":"Esta guía ayuda al administrador de aprovisionamiento a elegir un recorrido antes de configurar el DMS. Separa tres decisiones: cuándo existe el dispositivo, cómo se autoriza la solicitud y quién genera su clave. Ninguna de ellas concede por sí sola acceso en el destino."},"1165":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Recorrido"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Cuándo existe el dispositivo"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Qué compruebas"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Asignación manual"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"El operador lo crea antes de asociar un certificado."},"1170":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"ID, DMS propietario, CN del certificado y serie vinculada."},"1171":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"EST con `JITP`"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Se crea para un CN desconocido durante `/simpleenroll`."},"1173":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Credencial autorizada, ID libre, perfil, alta e identidad resultantes."},"1174":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"EST con `PRE_REGISTRATION`"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Debe existir antes de `/simpleenroll`."},"1176":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Registro aprobado, mismo DMS y condiciones de sustitución de tu versión."},"1177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"`JITP` de Lamassu crea inventario e identidad en Lamassu. JITP de AWS aprovisiona un destino en AWS; son decisiones diferentes."},"1178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Para una primera prueba desde el cliente, utiliza Enrola y conecta un dispositivo. Para preparar inventario sin EST, sigue Registro manual."},"1179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Encontrar cualquier dispositivo del mismo DMS activa el control `enable_replaceable_enrollment` antes de comprobar PRE\\_REGISTRATION. Con el flag desactivado, un dispositivo prerregistrado puede recibir `forbiddenNewEnrollment` incluso estando en **No Identity**. No se presenta ese recorrido como garantizado por seleccionar únicamente PRE\\_REGISTRATION."},"1180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Activar el flag permite repetir `/simpleenroll` para un ID existente. El backend programa un intento diferido de revocación del certificado anterior con `Superseded`; también puede ejecutarlo si después falla la emisión o vinculación. Si no había identidad, el intento puede fallar por falta de serie. El flag no es una transacción de sustitución ni garantiza restaurar el estado anterior."},"1181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Prueba el caso exacto de tu versión antes de habilitarlo en una población. Para una identidad ya operativa y una renovación autorizada, utiliza `/simplereenroll`; para recuperar una identidad, sigue Renovación y recuperación y confirma el estado persistido antes de reintentar."},"1182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"Decide por separado primer enrolamiento y reenrolamiento:"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Certificado cliente:** útil cuando cada equipo dispone de una credencial inicial cuya clave controla."},"1184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Webhook:** útil cuando otra autoridad conoce inventario, credenciales o derecho a solicitar un ID."},"1185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Certificado y webhook:** exige ambos controles en la operación configurada."},"1186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**NO\\_AUTH:** no acredita al solicitante; solo encaja cuando el control de admisión se resuelve de forma deliberada fuera de ese DMS."},"1187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"Autenticar un certificado inicial no demuestra por sí solo el derecho a elegir cualquier CN en la CSR. Define esa autorización en Identidad inicial y autenticación."},"1188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Opción"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Material que atraviesa EST"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave generada por el dispositivo"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"CSR pública y certificado; la clave permanece en el cliente."},"1192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave ya disponible en el dispositivo"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"CSR firmada con la clave existente y certificado nuevo."},"1194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave privada PKCS#8 y certificado en una respuesta multipart protegida por TLS."},"1196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Elegir ServerKeyGen no utiliza automáticamente el HSM o KMS de la CA para la clave del dispositivo. Revisa su contrato y extracción y la capacidad del dispositivo para instalar el material."},"1197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#comprueba-la-decisión","content":"Antes de extender el flujo, prueba alta permitida, credencial incorrecta, ID de otro DMS, solicitud repetida y recuperación tras un fallo. Conserva ID, serie, versión activa y error. Comprueba también aceptación y rechazo en el consumidor; un certificado emitido no implica que el destino lo conozca o permita operar."},"1198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"page","content":"Renovación y recuperación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real."},"1200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Prepara la renovación"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"Solicita el certificado sucesor"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Instala y comprueba la nueva pareja"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Recupera según el estado"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Operación continua"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"La renovación conserva el identificador del dispositivo y solicita un certificado sucesor. Es un proceso que debe completar el cliente: comprobar la respuesta, instalar la pareja correspondiente y demostrar que el consumidor la acepta. Las alertas de Lamassu avisan; no ejecutan esos pasos."},"1206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Consulta el certificado actual en Lamassu y compáralo con el instalado. Necesitas su sujeto, serie y fechas, además de la clave del cliente."},"1207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Comprueba el modo de autenticación de **re-enrollment**: es independiente del inicial. En `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, utiliza la identidad actual, no asumas que la credencial bootstrap está admitida."},"1208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Calcula el inicio de la ventana: `NotAfter` del certificado actual menos `reenrollment_delta`. Los umbrales preventivo y crítico producen estados/avisos; no amplían esa ventana."},"1209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Revisa **Revoke on Re-enrollment** y la recuperación si la instalación falla. Si está habilitado, Lamassu puede revocar la identidad anterior antes de que el cliente instale la nueva."},"1210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"El ejemplo continúa el tutorial EST, en la misma sesión Bash con `set -euo pipefail`, `umask 077` y `EST_BASE`. Usa una nueva clave compatible con el perfil. La conversión desde el certificado conserva el sujeto y copia solo SAN cuando existe; comprueba el sujeto y los nombres solicitados antes de enviarla. El backend comprueba el sujeto frente a la identidad actual: intenta igualdad de RawSubject y después compara CN, OU, O, L, ST y C. Volver a construir únicamente el CN puede perder atributos requeridos."},"1211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"La petición se autentica con `device.crt` y `device.key`; la CSR contiene la clave pública nueva. Comprueba también extensiones, fechas y correspondencia de serie con el slot actual en Lamassu. No vuelvas a enviar una solicitud que falló sin consultar ese estado: la emisión, la revocación anterior y la vinculación del sucesor pueden tener resultados parciales."},"1212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Conserva el resultado como `device.next.crt` y `device.next.key` hasta verificarlo. Cambia la pareja mediante una operación coordinada del almacén o configuración del dispositivo; evita exponer temporalmente un certificado con la clave de otra versión."},"1213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Prueba mTLS con el consumidor y verifica que utiliza la nueva serie. Confirma el historial y el certificado actual en Lamassu. Si **Revoke on Re-enrollment** estaba deshabilitado, la identidad anterior puede seguir válida: retírala conforme a la política de PKI después de probar el sucesor y comprueba la publicación y consumo de su revocación."},"1214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Si la identidad anterior ya está revocada, conservar sus archivos no permite restaurar una conexión válida. La recuperación requiere una credencial admitida y una intervención autorizada según la situación."},"1215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Situación"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Procedimiento"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Certificado vigente, fuera de ventana"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Programa la solicitud dentro de la ventana. No recurras a `simpleenroll` para saltarla."},"1219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Certificado vencido, clave disponible"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Con autenticación por certificado, revisa `enable_expired_renewal` y que Gateway permita presentar esa credencial. Siguen aplicándose revocación, sujeto y el resto de comprobaciones."},"1221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Renovación por webhook o `NO_AUTH`"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"La comprobación mTLS de vencimiento no se ejecuta en esos modos. Define la política de vencimiento y autorización en la admisión correspondiente; el flag no constituye una prohibición universal."},"1223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Clave perdida o inaccesible"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"No puedes probar posesión de la identidad anterior. Autoriza una nueva admisión y, si procede, sustitución controlada; revoca la identidad comprometida."},"1225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Identidad actual revocada"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"`simplereenroll` rechaza el certificado actual revocado. Investiga la razón y prepara un procedimiento de readmisión autorizado; no desactives autenticación para forzarlo."},"1227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Dispositivo sin identidad"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Usa el enrolamiento inicial. En un registro existente, comprueba la restricción de sustitución de aprovisionamiento."},"1229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Dispositivo retirado"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Revisa la decisión operativa antes de readmitirlo. El estado Decommissioned y la revocación de todo el historial no son equivalentes."},"1231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Timeout, HTTP 500 o fallo de instalación"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Inspecciona dispositivo, certificados emitidos e historial antes de reintentar. Puede haberse emitido un sucesor o revocado el anterior."},"1233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Programa las renovaciones con margen para desconexiones, distribución de confianza y comprobación del consumidor. Escalona solicitudes de la población y limita los reintentos dentro de la ventana; los errores de autenticación, sujeto o política requieren corregir su causa. Conserva un mecanismo de recuperación admitido y probado para las claves perdidas y las parejas que no pudieron instalarse."},"1234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Continúa con Distribución de confianza, Dispositivos e identidades y Diagnóstico."},"1235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación."},"1237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#diagnóstico-y-compatibilidad","content":"Diagnóstico y compatibilidad"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Códigos de error y diagnóstico"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Notas de compatibilidad"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica una operación y un dispositivo cada vez. Anota DMS/APS, endpoint, hora, código HTTP, serie presentada y CN de la CSR. Conserva la respuesta sin incluir claves privadas ni credenciales de webhook en el informe."},"1242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El controlador EST devuelve normalmente 400 al rechazar entrada y 500 cuando el servicio rechaza o falla la operación. Un 500 también puede representar una denegación de política; no implica que reintentar sea seguro. Gateway puede generar sus propios códigos y cuerpos. Revisa el cuerpo real y el resultado persistido."},"1243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Síntoma o mensaje"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Qué revisar"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"curl rechaza TLS, nombre o emisor"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"URL, reloj, SAN del servidor y raíz aprobada en `est-trust.pem`. Resolver la confianza en Despliegue; no omitir la verificación."},"1247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"404 o APS ausente"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Ruta pública `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}/{operation}` y DMS existente. El APS no es el nombre del servicio."},"1249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"400, error de CSR o formato"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`Content-Type: application/pkcs10`, Base64 de DER, firma válida y cuerpo conservado sin doble codificación."},"1251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Credencial ausente o certificado no válido"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Modo de la operación, CA validante, fechas, revocación y entrega de la credencial por Gateway. No confundir confianza TLS del servidor con CA de bootstrap."},"1253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El enrolamiento o el reenrolamiento rechaza un certificado por revocación no verificable"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Si el certificado lo gestiona Lamassu, si sus endpoints OCSP/CRL están configurados y son alcanzables desde el servicio, y si `allow_unverifiable_revocation` está activo en el bloque de esa operación. Consulta DMS y Revocación y comprobaciones."},"1255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Webhook deniega, expira o responde sin autorización"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Configuración, conectividad y respuesta JSON con `authorized: true`. No hay degradación automática a `NO_AUTH`."},"1257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`unexpected status code: <n>: redirects are not followed`"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El webhook respondió con una redirección. Configura la URL final absoluta `http` o `https` en la configuración del webhook; nunca se siguen redirecciones."},"1259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`webhook response exceeds 1048576 bytes`"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El receptor devolvió más de 1 MiB de JSON. Reduce la respuesta del webhook de autorización."},"1261":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`webhook config must not reference files`"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"La configuración del webhook apunta a archivos (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`). Para mTLS, introduce el certificado y la clave como PEM codificado en Base64 en `cert_content` y `key_content`, o como PEM en claro; elimina cualquier otro campo de archivo, incluido `ca_cert_file`, que no tiene equivalente en línea (el certificado del receptor debe encadenar con el almacén de confianza del sistema). Consulta la guía de credenciales del webhook en DMS."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`mtls_options.cert_content must be base64-encoded PEM`"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El valor no es ni PEM codificado en Base64 ni PEM en claro: es una ruta de archivo o es Base64 de datos que no son PEM. Introduce el certificado y la clave como PEM codificado en Base64, como el resto de certificados de la API, o como PEM en claro (consulta los ajustes del webhook en DMS). El mismo mensaje nombra `mtls_options.key_content` cuando el valor no válido es la clave."},"1265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`webhook mTLS certificate and key are invalid: …`"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El certificado y la clave no forman un par coincidente. Introduce ambos valores del mismo par; la comprobación se ejecuta al guardar el DMS y de nuevo en cada llamada del webhook."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"400 `struct validation error` al crear o actualizar un DMS"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"La configuración del webhook de la operación que lo usa no es válida. Revisa `external_webhook_settings` en DMS."},"1269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"HTTP 500 con cuerpo `err` en enroll o reenroll"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Los fallos del servicio llegan al cliente EST como 500 con un cuerpo de `err` más el mensaje; los errores de autorización del webhook se nombran ahí."},"1271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/