bution","content":"Esta guía se dirige a quien administra la confianza de dispositivos y consumidores. Necesitas inventario de emisores, acceso a los almacenes de confianza y un canal autenticado de actualización. Distribuir certificados es distinto de decidir cuáles serán anclas confiables."},"1306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Relación"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Material que prepara el responsable"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Dispositivo → servidor EST"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Raíz, cadena o pin previamente verificado del servidor y su nombre TLS."},"1310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"DMS → solicitante"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"CAs y reglas que autorizan la credencial inicial o de renovación."},"1312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Consumidor → dispositivo"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Raíces de la identidad operativa, intermedias, validación y permisos."},"1314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Un dispositivo que obtiene un certificado no configura automáticamente ninguna de esas relaciones en terceros. Revisa el modelo de confianza."},"1315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#qué-devuelve-cacerts","content":"El DMS puede incluir el certificado TLS downstream disponible, las Managed CAs elegidas y la CA de enrolamiento. No incorpora todos los ascendientes por seleccionar la emisora. El conjunto puede contener hojas, raíces e intermedias, incluso más de una jerarquía durante una migración."},"1316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#qué-devuelve-cacerts","content":"La posición no define la cadena. Identifica cada certificado por sujeto, emisor, AKI/SKI, firma y restricciones. Descarga e inspecciona con Cliente EST."},"1317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Mantén por separado la confianza inicial del servidor EST y la del consumidor de identidades."},"1318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Selecciona raíces que tu política haya aprobado como anclas."},"1319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Conserva intermedias para construir o presentar cadenas; no las conviertas automáticamente en raíces."},"1320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Presenta hoja e intermedias requeridas en mTLS. Normalmente no necesitas enviar la raíz al interlocutor que ya confía en ella."},"1321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Verifica cadena, fechas, nombres, usos y revocación desde el consumidor."},"1322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"No uses indiscriminadamente todo `cacerts.pem` como `-CAfile`: eso puede ampliar el conjunto de autoridades confiadas, ocultar intermedias faltantes o confiar una hoja TLS que tenía otra finalidad."},"1323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"Antes de cambiar Enrollment CA, inventaría equipos desconectados, bootstrap, certificados operativos y consumidores. Distribuye la nueva raíz y las intermedias necesarias; comprueba que una cohorte acepta cadenas antigua y nueva."},"1324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"En el DMS, separa las CAs distribuidas de las CAs de validación de reenrolamiento en `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings.client_certificate_settings.validation_cas`, utilizadas para la credencial de reenrolamiento. Esa lista es opcional porque la CA de enrolamiento siempre valida las credenciales de reenrolamiento, pero al cambiar la CA de enrolamiento, añade a ella la CA de emisión anterior para que las identidades de la CA antigua sigan reenrolándose durante el solapamiento. El validador prueba la CA de enrolamiento y después esas CAs con la hoja recibida; aceptar una cadena multinivel requiere verificar cómo llega al servicio y qué emisor está configurado."},"1325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"Cambia emisión, renueva por grupos y compara la serie instalada con el slot activo. Retira la confianza anterior cuando ningún equipo legítimo la necesite y tu política permita cerrar el solapamiento. Sigue Jerarquía y rotación para la operación PKI."},"1326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#comprueba-la-actualización","content":"Prueba una identidad antigua permitida durante el solapamiento, una nueva, una cadena desconocida y el resultado después de retirar la confianza antigua. Conserva versión del almacén, conjunto aprobado, fecha y resultado. `/cacerts` accesible solo demuestra distribución; no demuestra instalación ni aceptación por todos los dispositivos."},"1327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Integraciones"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos."},"1329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Arquitectura del conector"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Prerrequisitos"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Permisos IAM necesarios"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Parámetros de configuración"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Eventos y recursos de AWS"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#registro-de-la-ca-en-aws-iot-core","content":"Registro de la CA en AWS IoT Core"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#cómo-solicitar-el-registro","content":"Cómo solicitar el registro"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#estados-del-registro-de-la-ca","content":"Estados del registro de la CA"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#primary-account","content":"Primary Account"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#secondary-account-sni-only","content":"Secondary Account (SNI-only)"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#configuración-del-dms","content":"Configuración del DMS"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-none","content":"Modo `none`"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-auto","content":"Modo `auto`"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-jitp","content":"Modo `jitp`"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#estados-del-modo-de-registro-del-dms","content":"Estados del modo de registro del DMS"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-automático","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo automático)"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#ciclo-de-vida-del-thing","content":"Ciclo de vida del Thing"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-jitp","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo JITP)"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#sincronización-del-estado-del-certificado","content":"Sincronización del estado del certificado"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#estados-del-certificado","content":"Estados del certificado"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#desconexión-forzada-al-revocar","content":"Desconexión forzada al revocar"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-shadow-y-automatización","content":"Device Shadow y automatización"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#qué-escribe-el-conector-en-el-shadow","content":"Qué escribe el conector en el shadow"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#políticas-de-aws-iot","content":"Políticas de AWS IoT"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#solución-de-problemas","content":"Solución de problemas"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"La integración de Lamassu con AWS IoT Core cubre el puente entre la PKI gestionada por Lamassu y la plataforma de conectividad de AWS. Cuando un dispositivo obtiene su certificado a través del proceso de enrolamiento EST, el conector se encarga de que ese certificado y la identidad asociada sean reconocidos en AWS IoT Core sin intervención manual. El resultado es que el dispositivo puede autenticarse directamente en AWS con el mismo certificado X.509 que Lamassu emitió."},"1355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Desde el punto de vista del protocolo, el dispositivo se autentica ante AWS IoT Core mediante TLS mutuo (mTLS): presenta su certificado X.509 emitido por Lamassu como certificado de cliente, y AWS IoT Core verifica la cadena de certificados hasta llegar a la CA registrada en la cuenta. Lamassu actúa como autoridad de certificación (CA); el conector se encarga de que esa CA esté registrada en AWS y de que el certificado del dispositivo sea conocido por la plataforma antes de que el dispositivo intente conectarse (en modo `auto`) o en su primera conexión (en modo JITP)."},"1356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Este documento está dirigido tanto al administrador PKI, que necesita configurar el conector y registrar las CAs, como al desarrollador de firmware de dispositivos, que necesita entender cómo se nombran los Things, cómo funciona el Device Shadow y qué ocurre cuando un certificado se revoca. Para el desarrollador de firmware, el dato más importante es que el **nombre del Thing en AWS (ThingName) corresponde siempre al Common Name (CN) del certificado emitido por Lamassu**, independientemente del modo de aprovisionamiento."},"1357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector de AWS IoT Core es un proceso Go independiente, un binario o contenedor separado del núcleo de Lamassu. En un despliegue monolítico se compila por defecto (etiqueta de compilación `!noaws`) y se activa mediante `aws_iot_manager.enabled: true` en el fichero de configuración. En despliegues distribuidos, se ejecuta como un contenedor propio con acceso a los servicios de CA, DMS Manager y Device Manager de Lamassu a través de HTTP."},"1358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector no sondea los servicios de Lamassu periódicamente. En su lugar, **se suscribe al bus de eventos interno** de Lamassu (AMQP o AWS SQS/SNS, configurable) y reacciona a los eventos que le interesan: creación o actualización de CAs, creación o actualización de DMS, vinculación de identidad de dispositivo, cambio de estado de certificado, actualización de metadatos de certificado y actualización de metadatos de dispositivo. Este modelo orientado a eventos garantiza que la sincronización con AWS sea casi inmediata y no genere carga de sondeo."},"1359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Para evitar bucles infinitos, el conector ignora cualquier evento cuyo campo `source` de CloudEvent coincida con su propia URI de origen. Esto previene que las escrituras de metadatos que el propio conector realiza vuelvan a disparar el mismo flujo."},"1360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Cuando se ejecutan varios conectores en paralelo, por ejemplo, para distintas cuentas de AWS, cada instancia tiene su propio `connector_id`. Todos los metadatos que el conector escribe en Lamassu se almacenan bajo la clave `lamassu.io/iot/{connector_id}`, lo que permite coexistencia sin colisiones."},"1361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Antes de activar el conector es necesario disponer de una cuenta AWS con los permisos IAM adecuados y tener el conector correctamente configurado. El proceso de despliegue (Docker Compose, Kubernetes o binario) se describe en la documentación de despliegue."},"1362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"La identidad IAM con la que opera el conector debe tener al mínimo los siguientes permisos sobre los recursos de la cuenta destino:"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Acción IAM"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Propósito"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"`iot:GetRegistrationCode`"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Obtener el código de verificación para el registro de CA en Primary Account"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"`iot:RegisterCACertificate`"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/iot-fle