":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#antes-de-consultar-el-estado","content":"La aplicación permite la acción a esa identidad."},"2060":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#antes-de-consultar-el-estado","content":"El recorrido de emisión comprueba cadena y uso con OpenSSL. Esa comprobación no consulta automáticamente OCSP ni descarga una CRL. Un certificado presente en el inventario o una respuesta OCSP `Good` no sustituyen los demás criterios."},"2061":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Mecanismo"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Cuándo utilizarlo"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Qué debes mantener"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"OCSP"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Consulta del estado de un certificado concreto."},"2066":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Acceso al respondedor, verificación de la firma y política de caché/vigencia."},"2067":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"CRL"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Consulta local de muchos certificados o funcionamiento offline."},"2069":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Descarga periódica de una lista firmada por el emisor y rechazo de listas vencidas."},"2070":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"OCSP también puede devolver una respuesta reutilizable hasta `nextUpdate`; una CRL cambia al publicarse una versión nueva. Ninguno garantiza por sí solo que un consumidor conozca una revocación en el momento de guardarla."},"2071":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Si utilizas ambos, define cuándo se permite el mecanismo alternativo y qué hace el cliente si falla la descarga, la firma, la vigencia o devuelve `Unknown`. Aceptar una identidad cuando no puedes comprobar su estado debe ser una decisión explícita de tu aplicación."},"2072":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Acepta un certificado vigente, autorizado y con cadena conocida."},"2073":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Rechaza otro con raíz desconocida o uso incompatible."},"2074":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Revoca un certificado de prueba y verifica la respuesta OCSP o la nueva CRL."},"2075":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Comprueba que una conexión nueva con esa identidad se rechaza."},"2076":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Simula un endpoint inaccesible y evidencia vencida; observa si el resultado coincide con tu política."},"2077":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Conserva número de serie, emisor, razón de revocación, hora de consulta y tiempos de la evidencia. Una sesión ya abierta puede necesitar cierre o reautenticación explícita en el servicio consumidor; publicar revocación no la cierra automáticamente."},"2078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"Para una cadena con intermedias, valida también su estado según la política del consumidor. La CRL del emisor de una identidad final no reemplaza las comprobaciones de todas las CAs de la cadena."},"2079":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#comprueba-el-comportamiento-del-consumidor","content":"<Card title=\