quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si la creación falla, comprueba permisos, disponibilidad del motor y algoritmo seleccionado."},"2556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si OpenSSL no lee el archivo, vuelve a copiar el bloque PEM completo."},"2557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si fallan la firma o las fechas, revisa que hayas descargado el certificado de esta CA y que el reloj del equipo sea correcto."},"2558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"El diagnóstico PKI reúne las comprobaciones de emisión y dependencias criptográficas."},"2559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"C