ción, estado y revocación."},"2611":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registrar un dispositivo manualmente para asociar esta identidad al inventario de Lamassu."},"2612":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Preparar EST para que el dispositivo solicite sus siguientes identidades."},"2613":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"La aceptación en un consumidor requiere configurar su confianza, su comprobación de revocación y los permisos concedidos a la identidad."},"2614":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos de PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Crea una CA, emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba su cadena y su clave."},"2616":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-83/e